<p>You say that any Foundation personnel who exit SCP-5890 are to be terminated on-site.<br />
Now, does this mean that the anomaly is held on a site, and the entities are to be taken elsewhere on the site for termination, which would be &quot;on-site&quot;, or do you mean as soon as you see a Foundation personnel leaving the anomaly, they are the be immediately terminated, because that would be spelled &quot;On sight.&quot;</p>

